OL,5,G2100 Police Interceptors
OL,6,     FInterceptors hunt for thieves who
OL,7,     Fhad it away with ten grand's worth
OL,8,     Fof luxury jackets. When one of the
OL,9,     Fcoat-snatchers won't come quietly,
OL,10,     Fpolice dog Peggy needs to
OL,11,     Fintervene.
OL,12,G2200 Police: Night Shift 999
OL,13,     FPC Hayes pursues a man who has
OL,14,     Fbeen injecting himself in full
OL,15,     Fview of the public. On patrol on
OL,16,     Fthe M5, PC Merchant pulls over a
OL,17,     Fman he spots driving while
OL,18,     Fwatching TV on his phone.
